<title>PHILIPPINES: Vitarich posts net loss in 1996.</title>
<headline>Vitarich posts net loss in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poultry firm Vitarich Corp on Thursday reported a net loss of 367 million pesos in 1996 against a profit of 280 million pesos in the previous year.</p>
</text>
